post.description:
Places a manual bid on a running lot. On success the lot delta is pushed to every room (`live:lot`), affected bidders get `live:standing`, and an anti-sniping extension also pushes a fresh snapshot.

Rejections return **400** `{ error }` with the reason, including:
- lot not found / not in this auction; yankee auctions;
- bidding not started yet, or time is over;
- bidder not registered for the auction/lot, T&C not accepted, or IP already used by another bidder when IP restriction is on;
- amount bounds: opening bid ≥ start price (or start price + increment when "First Bid = SBP + Increment"), later bids ≥ winning + increment (≤ winning − decrement for reverse), multiples of the increment, at most 50 increments past the current price, and within the bid limit;
- rank-based auctions: bounds are relative to the bidder's own best bid, never the (withheld) winning price;
- a manual bid must beat the bidder's own active proxy (which it then retires).

**Access:** login required.
- Bidder portal users only.
